# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# The checked-in benchmark corpora, whose whole point is their bytes.
#
# `text=auto` above permits line-ending translation on checkout, and a corpus
# that is translated is a corpus whose digest no longer matches its manifest and
# whose byte-rate measurement is off by one byte per line. `-text` turns every
# form of normalization off for this subtree. See
# `cli/benches/corpora/README.md` and `design/PERFORMANCE.md` §3.1.
cli/benches/corpora/** -text
